# Ledger Shredder, played for real. The ruling's other half: "If Ledger Shredder was the first spell you cast this
# turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell." Turn 5 Bot1 casts the Shredder first and a Pyrite
# Spellbomb second; the Shredder is on the battlefield by then, so it connives - draws the third Spellbomb, discards
# it, and is a 2/4 flier.

